	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(40, 20, 560, 90)">TP Feature Engineering - Adult census income. Datasets descarga 'Adult census income' (target: income). Test &amp; Score: Cross validation, 10 folds, estratificada. En Test &amp; Score elegir Target class '&gt;50K' para ver F1/Precision/Recall de la clase premium.</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(40, 1000, 560, 70)">Preprocess (Normalize: standardize mu=0, sigma=1) va a la entrada Preprocessor de Logistic Regression: sin escalar, la regresion no converge (AUC ~0,72 -&gt; 0,58 con FE).</text>
	</annotations>
